  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PROMAC 2 - YARA strat. Partnership for Jobs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This initiative stems from a STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIP between MFA  &amp; YARA to promote jobs through climate smart  agriculture and access to modern agri inputs. NCBA CLUSA is the implementation partners, within the scope of the strategic  partnership between MFA &amp; YARA.</narrative>
  </description>
